{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function getHotkeyRegistrations(): SvelteHotkeyRegistrations;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getHotkeyRegistrations.svelte.ts#L58","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getHotkeyRegistrations.svelte.ts:58"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Svelte function that returns reactive access to all hotkey and sequence\nregistrations from the singleton managers."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is a standalone function that does NOT require the HotkeysProvider."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/SvelteHotkeyRegistrations.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SvelteHotkeyRegistrations"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Object with reactive "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"hotkeys"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sequences"},{"type":"text","value":" properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"<script>\n  import { getHotkeyRegistrations } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const registrations = getHotkeyRegistrations()\n</script>\n{#each registrations.hotkeys as reg}\n  <div>{reg.options.meta?.name} — {reg.triggerCount} triggers</div>\n{/each}","lang":"svelte"}],"headings":[{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction getHotkeyRegistrations(): SvelteHotkeyRegistrations;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getHotkeyRegistrations.svelte.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getHotkeyRegistrations.svelte.ts#L58)\n\nSvelte function that returns reactive access to all hotkey and sequence\nregistrations from the singleton managers.\n\nThis is a standalone function that does NOT require the HotkeysProvider.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SvelteHotkeyRegistrations`](../interfaces/SvelteHotkeyRegistrations.md)\n\nObject with reactive `hotkeys` and `sequences` properties\n\n## Example\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n  import { getHotkeyRegistrations } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const registrations = getHotkeyRegistrations()\n</script>\n{#each registrations.hotkeys as reg}\n  <div>{reg.options.meta?.name} — {reg.triggerCount} triggers</div>\n{/each}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: getHotkeyRegistrations\ntitle: getHotkeyRegistrations\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction getHotkeyRegistrations(): SvelteHotkeyRegistrations;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getHotkeyRegistrations.svelte.ts:58](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/svelte-hotkeys/src/getHotkeyRegistrations.svelte.ts#L58)\n\nSvelte function that returns reactive access to all hotkey and sequence\nregistrations from the singleton managers.\n\nThis is a standalone function that does NOT require the HotkeysProvider.\n\n## Returns\n\n[`SvelteHotkeyRegistrations`](../interfaces/SvelteHotkeyRegistrations.md)\n\nObject with reactive `hotkeys` and `sequences` properties\n\n## Example\n\n```svelte\n<script>\n  import { getHotkeyRegistrations } from '@tanstack/svelte-hotkeys'\n\n  const registrations = getHotkeyRegistrations()\n</script>\n{#each registrations.hotkeys as reg}\n  <div>{reg.options.meta?.name} — {reg.triggerCount} triggers</div>\n{/each}\n```\n"}
